Bar--Lounge--002.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">http://static.guim.co.uk/sys-images/...ounge--002.jpg</a><br /> <br /> Museum Hill<br /> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Museum_of_International_Folk_Art\" target=\"_blank\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Museum...ional_Folk_Art</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://museumhill.net/explore.php\" target=\"_blank\">http://museumhill.net/explore.php</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":380,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","user":"AzraelFirestorm","date":". 07-10-2018, 12:30 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-18T15:24:40-08:00","id":1018933,"title":"","content":"Mortal NPCs<br /> <br /> <b>Ghouls</b><br /> <br /> Travis Canter - Chauffeur and decades long lackey of Sheriff Brady. Appearing to be in his early 20s instead of deep into his 60s, thanks to the Blood, his shaggy brown hair often hides his supernaturally acute green eyes. Being around as long as he has makes him about as knowledgeable as any of the Sheriff's Hounds.<br /> <br /> Gabriel Greene - Chauffeur and attendant to Prince Santiago. Originally from New York, one of his more notable quirks is going on about the Mets and his particular feelings about &quot;The Damn Dodgers&quot; at the moment.<br /> <br /> Gerald Greene - Son of Gabriel and often private chauffeur for the Malkavian Primogen. He acts as an extension of the Apothecary Lounge's Elysium services, providing transportation to Elysium guests and even an evening's vessel. Gerald is quite talented at getting things done quietly and professionally.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":380,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","user":"AzraelFirestorm","date":". 05-04-2018, 01:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-15T23:24:58-08:00","id":1032507,"title":"","content":"Neonate PC:<br /> <br /> <br /> Artemis - City Gangrel. Childe of Brotha Damu.<br /> <br /> Artemis is a young and muscular man who lives by a &quot;Let It Die&quot; mentality which he gained a few years ago after hitting rock bottom. Unable to hold onto a decent job and with no family willing to support him, Artemis found himself living the life of a drifting hobo. Happenstance had him arriving eventually in Albuquerque, where he got into a fist fight with some local street punks whose strings were, unknown to Artemis, being pulled by one Russell DuBois. Impressed with his fighting prowess, Dubois embraced him. Artemis now works as a bouncer at Knockouts! Topless Bar, all the while waiting for his next fix of adrenaline.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":380,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","user":"AzraelFirestorm","date":". 08-09-2017, 09:33 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-13T02:56:26-07:00","id":1115444,"title":"","content":"<b>&quot;Uriel Incident&quot; Casualties</b><br /> <br /> Benji Cordova - Gangrel, loyal Seneschal to his Prince, Beloved Friend. Met Final Death at the hands of the infernal brood.<br /> <br /> Colfax - Nosferatu. Met Final Death with dignity and courage while defending the Malkavian Primogen, Elizabeth Jackson.<br /> <br /> Russell Dubois - Met Final Death while aiding the Primogen and Sheriff.<br /> <br /> Uriel - Nosferatu. Diablerized by Elizabeth Jackson.<br /> <br /> 200+ Nosferatu of the Cities Below. Identities of the victims are still being investigated. The Nosferatu Anarchs have been nearly erased by Uriel, with almost every victim noted to have been an active Anarch. Motives are still officially unclear.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore